name wtref
category Package
revision 55558
shortdesc Extend LaTeX's cross-reference system
longdesc This package extends the cross-reference system of LaTeX2e and
longdesc introduces concepts of namespace and scope. It also allows
longdesc users to customize reference formats. The package is part of
longdesc the WT Series. Prerequisite packages: xparse and xkeyval.
